      "q": "How much does Applied Research Associates make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Applied Research Associates has federal contract obligations of $320M in FY2026 to date. The company won 177 awards this fiscal year with an average award size of $1.8M. Obligations fell down 30.0% year over year compared with prior-year totals."
