    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Applied Research Associates?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense is Applied Research Associates' largest buyer, obligating $239M in FY2026 to date. The General Services Administration is the second largest buyer with $62.4M. Other buyers include the Department of Homeland Security with $11.7M and the Department of the Interior with $4.1M."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Applied Research Associates sell to the government?",
